        {
          "text": "Pack Tactics. The lion has Advantage on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the lion’s allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition.\nRunning Leap. With a 10-foot running start, the lion can Long Jump up to 25 feet.",
          "title": "Traits"
        },
        {
          "text": "Multiattack. The lion makes two Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Roar.\nRend. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Slashing damage.\nRoar. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one creature within 15 feet. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the start of the lion’s next turn.",
          "title": "Actions"
        }
